---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Before & After Gallery"
metaTitle: "Before & After Dental Photos – Tempe, AZ | 3rd Set Smiles"
description: "Real before-and-after photos from Dr. Matthew Phillips in Tempe, AZ: a full-arch implant restoration, a cosmetic smile makeover and rebuilt worn smiles."
permalink: /before-after-gallery/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Before & After Gallery", url: "/before-after-gallery/" }
---
{% from "partials/ba-cases.njk" import baCases, baConsentNote %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Before &amp; After Gallery</div>
    <h1>Real Smiles, <span>Real Transformations</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Authorized patient transformations by Dr. Phillips &mdash; real before-and-after results from care provided at 3rd Set Smiles.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cream">
  <div class="container">

    {% set publishedCases = beforeAfter | publishedCases %}
    {% if publishedCases.length %}
    {{ baCases(publishedCases, { heading: "h2" }) }}
    {{ baConsentNote() }}
    {% else %}
    <div class="notice center">
      <strong>More before-and-after cases are coming soon.</strong>
      <p style="margin-top:10px">In the meantime, <a href="/contact/">schedule a consultation</a> to talk through what&rsquo;s possible for your smile.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ba-cta fade-in">
      <h2>Wondering what&rsquo;s possible for your smile?</h2>
      <p>Results vary from person to person, but the first step is the same: an honest conversation about what&rsquo;s realistic for you.</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary" data-action="request-appointment">Schedule a Consultation</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" class="btn-outline btn-outline-dark" data-action="call-gallery">Call {{ site.phone.display }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
